{"id":"85cf4c1e923b6e9a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Base At Point","display":"df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point — ZFC Topo10 Base At Point","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point — ZFC Topo10 Base At Point","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-base-at-point — ZFC Topo10 Base At Point"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,x,\\mathcal B,U,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,x,\\mathcal B,U,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>（拓扑空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本原子定义的开局部基谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}base\\text{-}at\\text{-}point}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}base\\text{-}at\\text{-}point}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10BaseAtPoint}_S(\\mathcal B,X,\\tau,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land x\\in X\\land\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\tau\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(x\\in B)\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\bigl(x\\in U\\to\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq U)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这里采用开局部基：每个基元本身是含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的开集，并细化任意开邻域。</li>\n<li>全局拓扑基与点处局部基是不同层级，前者不应作为本定义的必要前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":